Package: lsof
Version: 4.88-r0
Description: LiSt Open Files tool
 Lsof is a Unix-specific diagnostic tool. Its name stands for LiSt Open
 Files, and it does just that.
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: BSD
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: lsof
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: ftp://lsof.itap.purdue.edu/pub/tools/unix/lsof/lsof_4.88.tar.bz2
